# A deliberately wrong alignment: a compilation (an event) as an information object. The check must find it inconsistent.
@prefix owp: <https://w3id.org/owp/ns#> .
@prefix dul: <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
owp:Compilation rdfs:subClassOf dul:InformationObject .
